OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after cat found dead in bin
OL,4,Abag
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA is appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter a cat was found dead inside a bin
OL,8,Fbag.
OL,10,FThe ginger and white tom was discovered
OL,11,Foutside a garage in Hilda Street,
OL,12,FGrimsby, at about 14:00 BST on 27
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FHe was soaking wet and vets at Grimsby
OL,16,FAnimal Hospital who examined him
OL,17,Fbelieve he may have drowned or been
OL,18,Finvolved in a water-related accident.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
