OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after cat found dead in bin
OL,4,Abag
OL,5,
OL,6,FRSPCA animal rescue officer Mollie
OL,7,FMasters said: "We believe the
OL,8,Fcircumstances surrounding the discovery
OL,9,Fof this poor cat's body are suspicious
OL,10,Fand we're appealing to anyone who may
OL,11,Fbe able to help [with] our inquiries to
OL,12,Fcome forward."
